## Solution

Single, low-effort fix. No policy work needed — policies are approved and the failing test is purely an endpoint-state check.

**Step 1 — Verify on the Mac (Paul/Iko, ~5 min)**
- Open `/Applications/1Password 7.app` or `1Password.app` (v8). If absent → install from https://1password.com/downloads/mac/ or via MDM/self-service.
- Sign in to the Normain 1Password tenant.
- Confirm Vanta Agent is running: menu bar → Vanta → "Sync now".

**Step 2 — Force re-scan**
- In Vanta: Tests → *Password manager records* → "Run test" (or wait up to 24h for next scheduled run).

**Step 3 — Verify in Vanta**
- Test should flip 2/3 → **3/3**. Control IAC-199 turns ✅.

**Effort**: 10 minutes for Iko/Paul + 5 min Kalle to nudge & verify.

**If 1Password is already installed**: have Iko reinstall the Vanta Mac app (Vanta only detects from a [supported list](https://help.vanta.com/) — older or non-Vanta-detected installs need reauth or app update).

